<p>
    I’m <strong>Rodrigo</strong>, <strong>Chief Engineer</strong> at the <strong>Ceuta Tax Authority (O.A. Servicios Tributarios)</strong>. I lead the <strong>technological transition</strong> and digital modernization of the organization, leveraging my expertise in <strong>Software Engineering</strong> and <strong>Artificial Intelligence</strong> to drive institutional innovation and operational efficiency.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    With a <strong>Master’s in AI</strong> from the <strong>University of Málaga</strong>, my background combines high-level industry experience and research. Previously at <strong>Tupl Inc.</strong>, I specialized in designing <strong>LLM-based systems</strong>, <strong>RAG pipelines</strong>, and <strong>AI agents</strong>. My technical portfolio spans from <strong>Deep Learning</strong> for MRI segmentation to <strong>Graph Neural Networks</strong> and the creation of the <strong>SAES Python library</strong>.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    I hold advanced certifications from <strong>Oracle</strong> and <strong>Nvidia’s Deep Learning Institute</strong> in <strong>Generative AI, Data Science,</strong> and <strong>Transformer-based NLP</strong>. Currently, I am focused on bridging cutting-edge AI research with <strong>scalable architectures</strong> in the public sector, ensuring production-grade excellence in mission-critical systems.
  </p></div>

